  "body": "@annevk, there are a number of streams and fetch things that would like to transfer single objects. I think [TransferHelper](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/infrastructure.html#transferhelper-%28-input,-targetrealm-%29) will do this for us. Its name seems to indicate it's meant as an internal abstract op though. Is there any reason we can't let it be used independently? If so, let's rename it to Transfer, and maybe call out in a note which algorithms from that section are allowed to be used externally?\n\n/cc @yutakahirano\n",
